{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapter":{"bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","chapterSlug":"ch12","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionCount":40,"questions":[{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0001","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":1,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":191,"y":438,"width":1029,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":540,"width":1160,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"基金依其流通交易方式可區分為哪兩種?","optionTexts":{"1":"委託型及受益型","2":"開放式及封閉式","3":"公司型及契約型","4":"公開型及隱含型"},"explanationText":"基金依其流通交易方式的不同,又可區分為開放式基金及封閉式基金,開放式基金乃是由投資人向基金發行之投信事業申請贖回,而封閉式型基金,投資+人可於集中市場買賣。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"9cbea7d63b241d0c6bfdae7aa886071cb6a8bcc6e019829f01c872c64f2b6169","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b07daa40df77e7b7aa9d8bbf916a45e81b1d2b57c3f69bcdac7f4bdebb616407"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0002","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":2,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":188,"y":692,"width":1032,"height":158,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":840,"width":1160,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何種有價證券並不在證券集中市場或證券商營業處所買賣流通交易?","optionTexts":{"1":"封閉式基金之受益憑證","2":"開放式基金","3":"認購權證","4":"轉換公司債"},"explanationText":"開放式基金乃是由投資人向基金發行之投信事業請求贖回, 封閉式型基金之受益憑證則於集中市場交易上市及流通。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"d6071bbe5c66a376b6841a812e4bdcf02606ce35d629960258badb4f5c787057","explanationSegmentsSha256":"306802eaf79092be0c08a5ae9f03e8976f67bb33c5278f5fc3af3e80e03849a0"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0003","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":3,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":189,"y":944,"width":1031,"height":158,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1092,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者「非」為證券投資信託契約應記載事項?","optionTexts":{"1":"證券投資信託基金之名稱及其存續期間","2":"基金及受益權單位淨資產價值之計算","3":"基金保管機構之義務與責任","4":"基金成立以來報酬率"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§2規定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"cc7aeaabe6d959effef71908c3da71863f129d4022f1fda98845a0494936c07f","explanationSegmentsSha256":"0c8f12d85d1ef0897d6ffdb1b3dc5273e34a3df5c378260e5c5a51604a16e21d"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0004","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":4,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":188,"y":1150,"width":1032,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1343,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者不是金管會訂定證券投資信託契約記載之各項費用及所受報酬計算上限之項目?","optionTexts":{"1":"購買受益憑證之費用","2":"受益人請求買回受益憑證之費用","3":"基金保管機構收取保管費之上限","4":"證券投資信託收益分配"},"explanationText":"參「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§3規定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"495cbbb03a8117725de81ed6ec70c8ec15ea077a0cce2052796fa4ac05e9304d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"799f866e513ebb41ed6ecd9a8cd495357bda02d78fc4247eb830ae225cb7e677"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0005","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":5,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-01.webp","x":191,"y":1401,"width":1029,"height":253,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":202,"width":1160,"height":112,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"運用證券投資信託基金投資有價證券之規定,下列何者為真?","optionTexts":{"1":"投資證券得信用交易","2":"投信事業對於基金資產運用得委託他人處理","3":"持有投資資產應登記於投信事業名下之專戶","4":"投信事業得不定期盤點基金資產"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§5第1項規定,證券投資信託事業得不定期盤點檢查基金資產。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"938668a88c643853ec8467bc3f3e43b5ddf43f9a47e383386092b0c3fbd2a309","explanationSegmentsSha256":"1451d7c17d1f2f4c4326ddd921af2c606f806e1d2da745b2ee94f64792f60d62"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0006","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":6,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":173,"y":304,"width":1047,"height":158,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":452,"width":1160,"height":247,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券投資信託事業對於所募集資金的用途,下列何者為合法用途?","optionTexts":{"1":"投資未上市股票","2":"投資政府債券","3":"對上市股票融券放空","4":"投資於單一公司發行之股票的金額超過該基金的10%"},"explanationText":"選項(1)依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§10第1項第1款規定,不得投資未上市櫃股票。選項(3)依第3款規定,不得從事證券信用交易。選項(4)依第8款規定,投資於任一上市或上櫃公司股票及公司債或金融債券之總金額,不得超過該證券投資信託基金淨資產價值之10%。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a1df4b5bee72026ccdfaef62d6b510bf967cd1dbf5dd11a79b449ac26dcb5971","explanationSegmentsSha256":"e38475829d7c698059d2598d63f28572d6e09d0cdef7f286bb89af54240da06b"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0007","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":7,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":171,"y":689,"width":1049,"height":162,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":841,"width":1160,"height":242,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券投資信託事業募集之基金,投資於任一公司所發行無擔保公司債之總額,不得超過該公司所發行無擔保公司債總額之多少?","optionTexts":{"1":"3%","2":"5%","3":"10%","4":"15%"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§10規定,證券投資信託事業募集基金,應依本辦法及證券投資信託契約之規定,運用基金資產,除金管會另有規定外,並應遵守下列規定:十三、每一基金投資於任一公司所發行無擔保公司債之總額,不得超過該公司所發行無擔保公司債總額之10%","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b9964a0be9ef87cfb30293ed870f8e48ce31edd5543ba6ac09a7bb31a574c7a3","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a048f10f00c23c51e19488a452d0a839183fb916f5ae4badafcf7738eb6ebfef"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0008","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":8,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":173,"y":1073,"width":1047,"height":207,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1270,"width":1160,"height":201,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以追蹤、模擬或複製標的指數表現,並在證券市場交易,且申購、買回採實物或依據證券投資信託契約規定方式交付之基金稱為","optionTexts":{"1":"組合型基金","2":"多重資產型基金","3":"指數股票型基金","4":"平衡型基金"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§37第1項規定,指數股票型基金指以追蹤、模擬或複製標的指數表現,並在證券交易市場交易,且申購、買回採實物或依據證券投資信託契約規定方式交付之基金。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"42dcf74fa87b8a2234b008c9e60c61b33ed788cee327c220886c168b852e7fe1","explanationSegmentsSha256":"516343daaec04e197a4dfab53ebac3d73087b500022ce058377b50f516c0099d"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0009","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":9,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-02.webp","x":174,"y":1461,"width":1046,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":174,"y":190,"width":1046,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":248,"width":1160,"height":205,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券投資信託事業基於特定投資方針運用基金投資,主動分析作成決策,並在證券交易市場交易,且申購、買回採實物或依據證券投資信託契約規定方式交付之基金,稱為","optionTexts":{"1":"主動式交易所交易基金","2":"被動式多資產ETF","3":"槓桿型ETF","4":"反向型ETF"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§41-1第1項規定,主動式交易所交易基金指證券投資信託事業基於特定投資方針運用基金投資,主動分析作成決策,並在證券交易市場交易,且申購、買回採實物或依據證券投資信託契約規定方式交付之基金。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"ece361d393e589b5e0db82e3c5fb8e9adae9e5afd8d172678fff0ab0ffdec6f1","explanationSegmentsSha256":"96d95b6d0f55a97c595ae612508051f9425b0ab2b0bd36f89976838d7e307924"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0010","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":10,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":171,"y":443,"width":1049,"height":247,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":680,"width":1160,"height":343,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"以追蹤、模擬或複製標的指數表現,並在證券交易市場交易,且申購、買回採實物或依據證券投資信託契約規定方式交付之基金,且基金之標的指數成分證券得同時包括股票及債券等投資項目者,可能為","optionTexts":{"1":"主動式交易所交易基金","2":"多資產型ETF","3":"槓桿型ETF","4":"反向型ETF"},"explanationText":"呈上題,選項(1)錯誤。另依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」 §37-1 第1項規定,證券投資信託事業募集指數股票型基金以追蹤、模擬或複製標的指數之正向倍數(簡稱槓桿型ETF)或反向倍數(簡稱反向型ETF)表現者,除依本辦法及證券投資信託契約之規定辦理外並應遵守下列規定:一、於基金名稱中明確顯示所追蹤、模擬或複製標的指數之單日正向倍數或反向倍數表現。另第2項規定,前項標的指數成分證券,不得同時包括股票及債券。故選項(3)(4)亦不正確。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"682278ec3bc4ffbfef0cca086c54954283253fa15df8745eae5da36de48124ef","explanationSegmentsSha256":"970644c7ddc0a402b67b9c76c9174a85d577dbd3b1e4abeea1141b916ca6564f"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0011","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":11,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":169,"y":1013,"width":1051,"height":64,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1067,"width":1160,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"一組合型基金至少會有幾個子基金？","optionTexts":{"1":"2","2":"3","3":"5","4":"10"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§43規定,每一組合型基金至少應投資5個以上子基金,且每個子基金最高投資上限不得超過組合型基金淨資產價值之30%。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"b81d4018daa93d76be80396a939d29f2e24c708dd44371b84d9f3937e041e89b","explanationSegmentsSha256":"a0d1957226ebc16f25a83442d503cfc87978dfa407b6215bd08e14ff6a8d2e16"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0012","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":12,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":152,"y":1214,"width":1068,"height":107,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1311,"width":1160,"height":67,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"一組合型基金的子基金,每個子基金最高投資上限不得超過淨資產價值多少比例?","optionTexts":{"1":"10%","2":"15%","3":"30%","4":"50%"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§43規定,每一組合型基金至少應投資5個以上子基金,且每個子基金最高投資上限不得超過組合型基金淨資產價值之30%。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"ec72cff0bf18cc9ce398bf58219f8e9a1c38ef5091a666e4b053da0c8cef65fd","explanationSegmentsSha256":"140f47181085c074a028ca404ec65900e0031a901c555806c914acbdfbe0184e"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0013","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":13,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":173,"y":1368,"width":1047,"height":104,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":1462,"width":1160,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"保本型基金之保本比率應達投資本金之多少比率以上?","optionTexts":{"1":"80%","2":"90%","3":"95%","4":"100%"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§44第3項規定,保本型基金之保本比率應達投資本金之90%以上。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"991f08722008119d314f002ab6923b7e888ae58713b8ff96a42cc0ce0017e24c","explanationSegmentsSha256":"14289e2cfee6f33e084699518c5126f0d82a0b9437082cfacfd6a70e298127a8"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0014","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":14,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-03.webp","x":178,"y":1562,"width":1042,"height":90,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":178,"y":194,"width":1042,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":252,"width":1160,"height":65,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"下列何者不可能為貨幣市場基金的主要投資標的?.","optionTexts":{"1":"可轉讓定期存單","2":"國庫券","3":"60天期附買回票券","4":"2 年期公債"},"explanationText":"貨幣市場基金運用標的以剩餘到期日在一年內之標的為限。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"a3c2005fbf41d943985310ab0e1335ce7225854d398b90c68ea61e95b2338787","explanationSegmentsSha256":"42678c1a31f42c5e91665f36139ed5479d46f0c07d018ef8c0836f3b04560fa0"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0015","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":15,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":173,"y":307,"width":1047,"height":109,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":406,"width":1160,"height":111,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"基金依其法律關係之不同可區分為哪兩種?","optionTexts":{"1":"外資型及法人型","2":"成長型及穩定型","3":"公司型及契約型","4":"股票型及債券型"},"explanationText":"基金依其法律關係之不同可區分為公司型及契約型。我國、日本、韓國之基金均屬契約型;美國之基金屬公司型。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"0a2ee103544bbf30c24729fbd8b7a6f9c99fb39ac20f0c4851048764063f0dc5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"db8a4a3c3a8347593d8b10512494a0a33dca74317878ec067c176eb2ac598164"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0016","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":16,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":173,"y":507,"width":1047,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":652,"width":1160,"height":157,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"開放式基金受益人要求贖回受益憑證,其買回價格之計算為","optionTexts":{"1":"按面額","2":"按契約公式","3":"依買回請求到達之當日或次一營業日基金淨值計算","4":"依買回請求當日基金淨值計算"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§70第2項規定,受益憑證之買回價格,以買回請求到達證券投資信託事業或其代理機構之當日或次一營業日之基金淨資產價值核算之。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"2a51b0e8e9c2c2b1277c5428807ac98fcaf22b49d3da379986a7e8251dcf8e29","explanationSegmentsSha256":"88e66a277747ac71fa9f24cd54f1faa9eada5b5d70239465b573f0369eb42ac3"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0017","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":17,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":174,"y":799,"width":1046,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":944,"width":1160,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券投資信託事業所經理投資國內之基金,應於受益人申請買回請求到達之次一營業日起,幾個營業日內給付買回款?","optionTexts":{"1":"三個營業日","2":"五個營業日","3":"七個營業日","4":"十個營業日"},"explanationText":"「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§71規定,證券投資信託事業應於受益人申請買回請求到達之次一營業日起五個營業日內,給付買回價金。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"9fc6444fd30f691388c741686363b81e62d224bcbf04b0d3aa84fa12a5ba48e4","explanationSegmentsSha256":"21fe57f5bfe82297c939acf02c9cab68271325b270395bf49411d48dd4f33ddc"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0018","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":18,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":173,"y":1090,"width":1047,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":1235,"width":1160,"height":248,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關證券投資信託基金淨資產價值計算,下列何者為非?","optionTexts":{"1":"應於每營業日計算","2":"遵守投信投顧公會之計算標準","3":"依法令及一般公認之會計原則為之","4":"淨值計算標準應由各基金公司自行擬訂"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§72規定,證券投資信託事業應於每一營業日計算基金之淨資產價值。基金之淨資產價值,應依有關法令及一般公認會計原則計算之。基金淨資產價值之計算,應由投信投顧公會擬訂基金資產價值之計算標準及計算錯誤之處理方式,報經金管會核定。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"fd636ecb6a4fa29e1565d75479c28ac3591368d7a6635742e4cb6b5dec92acf3","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b6c12abd5cf276fb5a3d6e2126788f7138b75d82ef5342b799d280b65901076d"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0019","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":19,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-04.webp","x":175,"y":1473,"width":1045,"height":206,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":213,"width":1160,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"一般而言,投資信託基金之存續期間為何?","optionTexts":{"1":"由受益人會議決定","2":"依證券投資信託契約約定","3":"由投信投顧公會擬訂","4":"由主管機關指定"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託基金管理辦法」§79規定,證券投資信託基金之存續期間,依證券投資信託契約之約定。倘另證券投資信託契約有經理不善或其他因素者,應經金管會核准後予以終止。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"0151d1a504029b5b8033b9711ffd5785ffc9aab20a77dcc7939566d74c9f6846","explanationSegmentsSha256":"511f7c40a8f39729c912a71bb59491ad5a4aa8bbb98216c82b88b735356fc373"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0020","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":20,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":165,"y":359,"width":1055,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":502,"width":1160,"height":205,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券投資信託事業募集之證券投資信託基金,除信託業兼營證券投資信託業務者外,應自開始募集日起幾日內募集成立?","optionTexts":{"1":"15日","2":"20日","3":"30日","4":"60日"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託事業募集證券投資信託基金處理準則」§7 規定,證券投資信託事業經核發營業執照後,應於一個月內申請募集符合主管機關規定之證券投資信託基金(第一項);並應於核准函送達日起6個月內開始募集,30天內募集成立該基金(第二項)。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"8647b34e10bbb19b91da0e02f68eb817ef99218e0fe46b5d72341b41a42f976d","explanationSegmentsSha256":"55a1029108e4a1852bd2730c88ecdc7032badfc0c7e6c504863d7620d457d672"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0021","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":21,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":163,"y":697,"width":1057,"height":155,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":842,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券投資信託事業經核發營業執照後,應於首次募集基金案件經核准函送達日起多久內開始募集?","optionTexts":{"1":"1個月","2":"3個月","3":"6個月","4":"12個月"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託事業募集證券投資信託基金處理準則」§7 規定,證券投資信託事業經核發營業執照後,應於一個月內申請募集符合主管機關規定之證券投資信託基金(第一項);並應於核准函送達日起6個月內開始募集,30天內募集成立該基金(第二項)。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c42730b002a0c3ceba380360d32400fc0df14d7606b9c17fb51abd51b2d30059","explanationSegmentsSha256":"f3e4c1bd91a8e7a71f0983678abe7a82f8a6857b09a818d61763213318e1d774"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0022","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":22,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":162,"y":900,"width":1058,"height":110,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":1000,"width":1160,"height":202,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"證券投資信託事業經核發營業執照後,應於一個月內申請募集基金, 其最低成立金額為","optionTexts":{"1":"10億元","2":"15億元","3":"20億元","4":"30億元"},"explanationText":"依「證券投資信託事業募集證券投資信託基金處理準則」§7 規定,除他業兼營證券投資信託業務者外,應於一個月內申請募集符合下列規定之證券投資信託基金:二、證券投資信託基金者,最低成立金額為新臺幣20億元。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"af0b966b7d7d032939761ca65c5c36c1e43cbf9e9cc0eb0946251518dc5c8b9e","explanationSegmentsSha256":"4645fb367922a335a3ddd12afcc70309ad81ea5a0e5d1cedd8283c0ffef142c8"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch12-pdf-0023","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第十二章","chapterTitle":"第十二章","number":23,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第十二章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch12/page-05.webp","x":161,"y":1192,"width":1059,"height":153,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/secu